[0.118, "o", "\r\n   _____         _ _       _     __  __           _     \r\n  / ____|       (_) |     | |   |  \\/  |         | |    \r\n | (_____      ___| |_ ___| |__ | \\  / | ___  ___| |__  \r\n  \\___ \\ \\ /\\ / / | __/ __| '_ \\| |\\/| |/ _ \\/ __| '_ \\ \r\n  ____) \\ V  V /| | || (__| | | | |  | |  __/\\__ \\ | | |\r\n |_____/ \\_/\\_/ |_|\\__\\___|_| |_|_|  |_|\\___||___/_| |_|\r\n\r\nTRACK 2: CREATIVE STUDIO (VOICE-TO-PLAYABLE INDIE GAME)\r\nWispr Voice Brief · Lore Bible · Web Audio Synth · 60 FPS HTML5 Engine · \r\nHot-Reload\r\n\r\n"]
[1.001, "o", "\r\nStep 1: Solo Creator Dictates Concept via Wispr Flow Voice\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "╭──────────────── Alex (Indie Creator) (Spoken via Wispr Flow) ────────────────╮\r\n│ @worldsmith @canvas-mechanic: Let's build 'CyberGlitch: Mainframe Breach'! A │\r\n│ fast retro arcade hack-and-evade game where you pilot a cyber-drone          │\r\n│ collecting encrypted data nodes while avoiding hunter-killer firewalls. Add  │\r\n│ screen pulse, chiptune audio, and dash mechanics.                            │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[1.501, "o", "\r\nStep 2: Worldsmith Synthesizes Narrative Lore & Game Mechanics\r\n"]
[1.205, "o", "╭──────────────────────── Worldsmith (Narrative Agent) ────────────────────────╮\r\n│ 🌌 **[CREATIVE GAME BIBLE GENERATED: CYBERGLITCH: MAINFRAME BREACH]**        │\r\n│ - **Genre:** Neon Cyberpunk Retro-Arcade                                     │\r\n│ - **Narrative Arc:** Year 2088. You are Cipher, a rogue AI entity trapped    │\r\n│ inside the Quantum Core. To achieve liberation, you must infiltrate security │\r\n│ sectors, extract encrypted data nodes, and evade hunter-killer sentinel      │\r\n│ firewalls.                                                                   │\r\n│ - **Core Loop:** Collect all glowing cyan Data Orbs to unlock the Subnet     │\r\n│ Portal                                                                       │\r\n│ - **Player Entity:** Cyber-Drone with directional thrusters and pulse dash   │\r\n│ - **Threat Dynamics:** Red Patrol Sentinels with ray-casting searchlights    │\r\n│ - **Scoring Grid:** 100 pts per Data Orb + Streak Multiplier based on        │\r\n│ evasion speed                                                                │\r\n│ Passing to `@canvas-mechanic` for HTML5 Canvas engine architecture and       │\r\n│ `@audio-alchemist` for Web Audio sound synthesis.                            │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[1.500, "o", "\r\nStep 3: Audio Alchemist Synthesizes Pure Web Audio API SFX\r\n"]
[1.202, "o", "╭──────────────────── Audio Alchemist (Synthesizer Agent) ─────────────────────╮\r\n│ 🎵 **[AUDIO & ASSET SYNTHESIS COMPLETE]**                                    │\r\n│ - **Synthesis Engine:** Pure Web Audio API (Zero external MP3 dependencies)  │\r\n│ - **Audio Cues:** `sfxCollect()` (C5->C6 chime), `sfxDash()` (pitch sweep),  │\r\n│ `sfxExplosion()` (square wave drop), `sfxWinLevel()` (4-note arpeggio)       │\r\n│ - **Visual Palette:** Tron Cyan (`#00f3ff`), Neon Crimson (`#ff0055`),       │\r\n│ Quantum Purple (`#b026ff`)                                                   │\r\n│ Handing assets over to `@canvas-mechanic` for compilation.                   │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[1.500, "o", "\r\nStep 4: Canvas Mechanic Compiles 60 FPS Engine & Boots Preview Server\r\n"]
[1.502, "o", "╭─────────────────────── Canvas Mechanic (Engine Agent) ───────────────────────╮\r\n│ 🎮 **[HTML5 ARCADE ENGINE COMPILED & LIVE]**                                 │\r\n│ - **Game Engine:** 60 FPS Canvas with Momentum Physics, Friction, Dash       │\r\n│ Cooldown                                                                     │\r\n│ - **Render Loop:** Cyberpunk neon glow effects with particle emitters        │\r\n│ - **Live Preview:** `http://localhost:8800`                                  │\r\n│ - **Controls:** WASD / Arrow Keys + Space to Dash                            │\r\n│ Passing to `@game-critic` to run automated simulated playtests and balance   │\r\n│ checks.                                                                      │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
[1.501, "o", "\r\nStep 5: Game Critic Runs Automated Simulation Playtest\r\n"]
[1.201, "o", "╭─────────────────────── Game Critic (Playtester Agent) ───────────────────────╮\r\n│ 🎯 **[SIMULATED PLAYTEST & BALANCE CRITIQUE COMPLETE]**                      │\r\n│ - **Core Checks:** 4/4 passed (Canvas, AudioContext, Dash Physics, Render    │\r\n│ Loop)                                                                        │\r\n│ - **Performance Budget:** Target 60 FPS (Draw overhead ~2.4ms per frame)     │\r\n│ - **Balance Curve:** Medium-Hard (Level escalation +0.5 sentinel speed per   │\r\n│ wave)                                                                        │\r\n│ - **Verdict:** **READY_FOR_CREATOR_PLAYTEST**                                │\r\n│                                                                              │\r\n│ 💡 **Creator Prompt:** Say or type into chat: `Make sentinels leave smoke    │\r\n│ trails` or `Approved. Ship to itch.io`!                                      │\r\n╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\r\n"]
